      }
    },
    "Der Plan hat %lld Einheiten pro Woche. Wähle mindestens so viele Tage.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The plan has %lld sessions a week. Choose at least that many days."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Plan hat %lld Pflicht-Einheiten pro Woche und bis zu %lld mit freiwilligen. Wähle mindestens %lld Tage.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The plan has %lld required sessions a week and up to %lld including optional ones. Choose at least %lld days."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Plan ruht, weil zehn Tage keine Fahrt dazukam. Fortsetzen, wann es passt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your plan is paused because there was no row for ten days. Resume whenever it suits you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Ruhepuls muss unter dem Maximalpuls liegen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resting heart rate must be below max heart rate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Simulator liefert dieselben Daten wie PM5 und Pulsgurt. Solange er läuft, werden echte Geräte ignoriert.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The simulator sends the same data as the PM5 and heart rate strap. While it runs, real devices are ignored."
